  <body>

    <div>

      <p begin="00:05.490" end="00:09.001" ttm:agent="v1">Get in my way and try to block me, I'ma show aggression</p>

      <p begin="00:09.001" end="00:11.001" ttm:agent="v1">Slide on your block like Danny Glover with a lethal weapon</p>

      <p begin="00:11.001" end="00:14.001" ttm:agent="v1">I ****** your thot, she gave me top, I guess that's my confession</p>

      <p begin="00:14.001" end="00:18.001" ttm:agent="v1">Got no regrets, I made mistakes, but I learned from my lessons</p>

      <p begin="00:18.001" end="00:21.001" ttm:agent="v1">Trappin' by the stu, villains pull up to the coupe</p>

      <p begin="00:21.001" end="00:24.001" ttm:agent="v1">My car ain't got no roof, thought this shit was bulletproof</p>

      <p begin="00:24.001" end="00:27.001" ttm:agent="v1">I can't feel my face, smokin' on Gorilla Glue</p>

      <p begin="00:27.001" end="00:29.001" ttm:agent="v1">Zoomin' in the coupe, that's the shit I like to do</p>

      <p begin="00:29.001" end="00:33.001" ttm:agent="v1">These is yellow diamonds, *******nin' like I'm Pikachu</p>

      <p begin="00:33.001" end="00:36.001" ttm:agent="v1">I'm a boss nigga, get that bag and make the moves</p>

      <p begin="00:36.001" end="00:39.001" ttm:agent="v1">No, I don't like to lose, so I be goin' in, yeah</p>

      <p begin="00:39.001" end="00:42.001" ttm:agent="v1">I'm tryna cop a Benz, yeah, pull up and drop like ten, yeah</p>

      <p begin="00:42.001" end="00:45.001" ttm:agent="v1">You tryna chase the life (what?) well I'm tryna chase the bands, yeah</p>

      <p begin="00:45.001" end="00:48.001" ttm:agent="v1">She wanna ****** with friends, yeah, I got 'em in the trance, yeah</p>

      <p begin="00:48.001" end="00:51.001" ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, but now they tell me I switched up</p>

      <p begin="00:51.001" end="00:54.001" ttm:agent="v1">Take this Backwood to the face, then grab my cup</p>

      <p begin="00:54.001" end="00:58.001" ttm:agent="v1">Shawty say she comin' through, she on the way to ******</p>

      <p begin="00:58.001" end="01:01.001" ttm:agent="v1">It's a lot of lust, not a lot of love</p>

      <p begin="01:01.001" end="01:03.001" ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, I stack it up, can't get enough</p>

      <p begin="01:03.001" end="01:07.001" ttm:agent="v1">Seen your shawty with you, she look at me and she blush</p>

      <p begin="01:07.001" end="01:10.001" ttm:agent="v1">I'm a jiggy ******, I don't take her out for lunch</p>

      <p begin="01:10.001" end="01:13.001" ttm:agent="v1">It's a lot of lust, not a lot of love</p>

      <p begin="01:13.001" end="01:16.001" ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, nigga, not a lot of love</p>

      <p begin="01:16.001" end="01:18.001" ttm:agent="v1">It's a lot of lust, not a lot of love</p>

      <p begin="01:18.001" end="01:21.001" ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, nigga, not a lot of love</p>

      <p begin="01:21.001" end="01:25.001" ttm:agent="v1">It's a lot of lust, not a lot of love</p>

      <p begin="01:25.001" end="01:27.001" ttm:agent="v1">Not a lot of love</p>

      <p begin="01:27.001" end="01:31.001" ttm:agent="v1">Rollin' in the coupe and she was rollin' off the drugs</p>

      <p begin="01:31.001" end="01:34.001" ttm:agent="v1">Lookin' for the one, girl, you know that I'm the plug</p>

      <p begin="01:34.001" end="01:37.001" ttm:agent="v1">I be booted up with my shooters in the truck</p>

      <p begin="01:37.001" end="01:40.001" ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, and broski keep it and it's tucked</p>

      <p begin="01:40.001" end="01:43.001" ttm:agent="v1">****** talkin' 'bout it, but he never runnin' up</p>

      <p begin="01:43.001" end="01:45.001" ttm:agent="v1">Put this shit in motion, so I'm never stayin' stuck</p>

      <p begin="01:45.001" end="01:49.001" ttm:agent="v1">Don't be actin' starstruck every time they show you love</p>

      <p begin="01:49.001" end="01:51.001" ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, but now they tell me I switched up</p>

      <p begin="01:51.001" end="01:55.001" ttm:agent="v1">Take this Backwood to the face, then grab my cup</p>

